nd playing the demo means a lot to me. It helps me understand how you play, what you enjoy, what works, and what still needs improvement.Herd League is still evolving.I have plenty of ideas for its future, and the final game may look quite different from what yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:31:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694667","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5107970-1843481262690133","game_id":"steam-5107970","kind":"announcement","title":"The Herd League Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"The Herd League demo is now live on Steam!Build your herd, manage your pasture, and compete against other farmers as you race to grow your farm.In the demo, you can:Build and grow your herdBreed and trade animalsExpand your pasture and manage grassProtect your animals from wolf attacksAdapt to changing weatherCompete in the League RunTry a longer Single RaceThe demo is available in multiple languages and gives you a first look at the core Herd League gameplay.If you enjoy it, wishlist Herd Leagu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T18:29:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690133","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5107970-1842212951297975","game_id":"steam-5107970","kind":"announcement","title":"Herd League Demo Is Coming!","summary":"The Herd League demo is coming to Steam!I've been working on the game, polishing the farm, improving the visuals, and getting the core gameplay ready for its first public release.In the demo, you'll be able to:Build and grow your herdManage your pasture and keep enough grass for your animalsBreed and trade animalsAdapt to c